{"step_index":384,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-14T04:15:41Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-14T13:15:41+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-10-14T13:15:44+09:00\nThe search for \"site:apps.apple.com \"NomadHer\"\" returned the following summary:\n**NomadHer: Solo Female Travel** is available on the Apple App Store for iPhone and iPad[1]. \n\n### **About the App**\n* **Developer:** NomadHer Inc.[1]\n* **Purpose:** A global community and safety-focused application designed for female globetrotters to encourage and empower safe solo travel[2].\n* **Key Features:**\n  * **Global Community Feed:** Share travel stories, ask questions, exchange tips, and address worries about solo traveling with women worldwide[2].\n  * **Local Search & Messenger:** Connect with nearby female travelers or local women to find travel buddies and make friends on the road[2][3].\n  * **Events & Workshops:** Participate in online and offline events, festivals, and workshops tailored for female travelers[2].\n  * **Solo Travel Guidebook:** Access curated guides and essential resources created in collaboration with fellow community members (*NomadHers*)[2].\n  * **Safety & Privacy:** Employs registration management and a community built on mutual respect to protect user privacy and security[2].\n\nSources:\n[1] [apple.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG46bnM_1aenACd0Q7oB92gzdl4-F5CYkbdcGxDAlClS77WcqrOMkYCYJ3XFC8fvRlrKgAH1jN3MGtGnr1Nnqh0-3DVxUCjKzjM7stuNABE28WHmhKeEszamIXHJFduTxX6NiHm2i5UZFSIDRfZNWsgiH4Nf1saRPM=)\n[2] [apple.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFQ7Y3FXZQm3ONvSZKM_gxvw9krdiCLgUfNWP31NyOuNpizn5_dsUADJtxXbF4jXSE2UcubyoT17z-5sWeKpiLXf39oriKK7KIM2_xsZbKe21lMN_UHooPqOMs8gVF3vteeAiC5rviaHAEHBmWzdw3Ol9y-4_xLHECjXHTd)\n[3] [nomadher.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHnaDP2Hdtk0pm3a7QhbD5MV5yw2ptgqxexnAjHOIspLbIZU6pUi2MuvBcRKOui34iJuS149H76Ynd