{"step_index":388,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-14T04:15:58Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-14T13:15:58+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-10-14T13:16:01+09:00\nThe search for \"site:nomadher.com/privacy OR site:nomadher.com/terms OR site:nomadher.com/contact\" returned the following summary:\nHere is the information gathered from NomadHer’s official pages corresponding to your query:\n\n### 1. Contact Information\n* **General Inquiries & Support Email:** [aloha@nomadher.com](mailto:aloha@nomadher.com)[1]\n* **Instagram:** [@nomad_her](https://instagram.com/nomad_her)[1]\n* **Global Office Locations:**\n  * **South Korea (Busan - Headquarters):** BIFC 55th floor, Nam-Gu, Busan, South Korea[2][3]\n  * **South Korea (Seoul):** Chenonggyecheonro-85, 9th floor, Seoul, South Korea[1]\n  * **France (Paris):** Station F, 5 Parvis Alan Turing, Paris, 75013, France[1]\n\n---\n\n### 2. Terms of Service Summary\n* **Governing Entity:** NomadHer.LTD, a corporation organized under the laws of South Korea[3].\n* **Agreement:** By accessing or using the NomadHer platform (including their website, mobile application, and related services), you agree to comply with and be bound by their Terms of Service[3]. \n\n---\n\n### 3. Privacy Policy Highlights\n* **Data Protection Officer (DPO):** Hyojeong KIM ([aloha@nomadher.com](mailto:aloha@nomadher.com))[2]\n* **Data Handling:** NomadHer collects user information (such as registration and identity verification details like IDs and selfies to ensure a safe, women-only community environment) as outlined in their privacy guidelines[2][4].\n\nSources:\n[1] [nomadher.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGkcqfUqNo8KhNb5DyyYAn6dinTnQ33MSfhv1EFeej67cd8D6mqnuUjwfK4h2t8Uur4A18Ll2sTpwndGHPQFgzBrDeHt611wMecgj3rvP5ujFA69YUepg==)\n[2] [nomadher.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEvJgLE1WnN8y10_TpKqLFK5FULD7sCZ4BTa7DaN2H4cUk9xLuVEtGwB0R78b5TSan