{"step_index":399,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-14T04:17:00Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-14T13:17:00+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-10-14T13:17:03+09:00\nThe search for \"\"노매드헐\" 전화번호 OR \"309-86-01593\" OR \"2023-부산남구-0171\"\" returned the following summary:\n여성 여행자 커뮤니티 플랫폼 **‘노매드헐(NomadHer)’**(주식회사 노매드헐)과 관련하여 문의하신 정보는 다음과 같습니다[1][2].\n\n* **사업자등록번호:** 309-86-01593[3]\n* **통신판매업신고번호:** 2023-부산남구-0171[4]\n* **대표 전화번호:** 공식적으로 공개된 대표 유선 전화번호는 별도로 지정되어 있지 않으며[5], 앱 내 고객센터 및 이메일(`aloha@nomadher.com` 또는 `hyo@nomadher.com`)을 통해 주로 소통 및 문의가 이루어집니다[6]. \n* **본사 주소:** 부산광역시 남구 문현금융로 40, 부산국제금융센터(BIFC) 55층[7]\n\nSources:\n[1] [nextunicorn.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQElHraXsfzuhcGQZRd6eDF83kXkGcwaJDA0RfI5VVXKTNhE6M3i7zvQ_rlWfQlf-MrplHpkCF8rlTLDHcoi7GUqLhnBbfZI5zMgSbSS9Ru87FdnDHI4EGFeOCI66ggdZanBH9l7TgtmZEM=)\n[2] [thevc.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHy91T8rlmb3a_2KmU5Cq6d3bkLOtuJWiQAmaZpbimn8lOSGXZa--BjKoEAVc_JX1kyqKLdFJ1w52JhuQeh_Pn-JKVuWQ_Tpokmvfcux96x)\n[3] [114.co.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF7MHyrEvo40HoIzk40ByKP5Qu2y9wGDmyNmSFs7h3DYiRA7d9CrMa5R9FtCTVnce59sQhkwvVee6qLOO2XOP0ZDHsPkkobnXEjSDQ32V4cHXqDEn8EApwSCJe25c8A5JTflfyiqIE8aPA=)\n[4] [wanted.co.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFcJx7vAD09USddmocjfrhOwh5z8up-DDj3gK_D5_EVfacq6NmOy3486CIOJe-acjO_IIBlT9-lMdM4wnW7Jb-ilw45Y6Bsq_c-IC_m0DpsYGuakdKq5YRSHYVrsA==)\n[5] [thevc.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHy91T8rlmb3a_2KmU5Cq6d3bkLOtuJWiQAmaZpbimn8lOSGXZa--BjKoEAVc_JX1kyqKLdFJ1w52JhuQeh_Pn-JKVuWQ_Tpokmvfcux96x)\n[6] [apple.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEHHEDmcBCMw-DmZxXUKC1lVH8QNkLA-24Pu3qx55upFxLur4TkCmSN7WG9yJkoIGj5L3ZVpATNbxeazEBSzntE5o_aokK793VtS1WToWwiL-MbWTY0tqAUzDoMXkgbSWl4PPNqck7tBdURbO6iwJ6_pJW_-VyuuPlUMcnnfQMuigxdSJjftmVl